---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="About this blog and its author" lang="en">
  <article class="prose prose-slate max-w-none dark:prose-invert">
    <h1 class="font-pixel text-xl text-accent">About</h1>
    <p>
      Hi! I'm Parker. This is my technical blog, where I write about software development and
      the ups and downs of my career.
      <br /><br />
      A lot of people may have given up on blogging in the age of AI, but I still think there's
      value in recording how I think through problems and what I learn about my career.
      <br /><br />
      Asking AI doesn't mean I'll understand the answer right away. It can also make things up,
      and sometimes I can't tell whether what it says is right. Since I already take notes when
      that happens, I might as well organize those notes and share them here.
      <br /><br />
      I also want to move my technical writing out of my
      <a href="https://www.parkerchang.life" class="text-accent">personal blog</a> so that site
      can stay focused on other things.
      <br /><br />
      I'll gradually add notes for full-stack software engineering interviews and write-ups of
      my contributions to Apache Kafka.
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"><time datetime="2026-10-06T18:05:00+09:00">Last updated: 2026-10-06</time></p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
